[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Lift the bonnet lid.</p><p>1. Undo the wing fixing bolts.</p><p>2. Extend wings (2a) slightly and unscrew bolts (2b) from both sides\nof the vehicle.</p><p>3. Unscrew the nuts.</p><p>4. Remove the crossmember.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045300.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the crossmember\nis not damaged.</p><p>Position the beam and tighten the bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT BEAM WITH HEADLAMP SEATS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Position the wings and do up the bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT WING. BODYSHELL</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Check the wings and beam are aligned.</p>"]]